<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Recu {{ receipt.receipt_number }}</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #17343a; background: #f4f8f7; margin: 0; padding: 32px; }
        .sheet { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4eceb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 36px; }
        h1 { margin: 0; } p { color: #718186; } .meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin: 24px 0; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 18px 0 28px; } th, td { padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f1; text-align: left; }
        .total { font-size: 22px; } .actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; } a, button { background: #0f7771; color: #fff; border: 0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 14px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; }
        .ghost { background: #17343a; } @media print { .actions { display: none; } body { background: #fff; padding: 0; } .sheet { border: 0; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<article class="sheet">
    <p>Ecole Horizon · Cocody, Abidjan · 2025 - 2026</p>
    <h1>Recu de paiement</h1>
    <div class="meta"><div><strong>{{ receipt.receipt_number }}</strong><br>Facture {{ receipt.invoice_number }}</div><div>{{ receipt.issued_at }}</div></div>
    <p>Recu de <strong>{{ receipt.last_name }} {{ receipt.first_name }}</strong> ({{ receipt.class_name }}) pour {{ receipt.tariff_label }}.</p>
    <table>
        <tr><th>Mode</th><td>{{ receipt.method }}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Date de paiement</th><td>{{ receipt.payment_date }}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Montant de la facture</th><td>{{ receipt.invoice_amount|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} F CFA</td></tr>
        <tr class="total"><th>Montant encaisse</th><td>{{ receipt.amount|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} F CFA</td></tr>
    </table>
    <p>Document genere par l'application de gestion scolaire. Conservez ce recu.</p>
    <div class="actions"><button type="button" onclick="window.print()">Imprimer</button><a class="ghost" href="{{ path('app_finance') }}">Retour caisse</a></div>
</article>
</body>
</html>
